<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 582 MLN POLISH FIXED BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 582 MLN POLISH FIXED BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 431 million zlotys of Poland's 16-percent two-year bonds and for 151 million zlotys of 12-percent five-year bonds at the treasury's joint 700 million zloty primary tender, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
